# Judge6-8-1

# BGM変更：rAwTell Owk...
@bgm Bgm_7_1

@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@pauseTrial false

@hideStageScreen 1

@char Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate "ボクはべつに<br>ヒロちゃんを<br><link=\"Objection_02_01_08_01\">告発</link>したかったわけじゃ<br>ないんだ。"

@char Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate だから……<br>本当は言いたくなかった。

@char Hanna.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Normal_Open
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate それはどうしてですの？

@char Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Flushed_Middle,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate だって、<br>ヒロちゃんはボクが<br>ここに来る前から知ってる<br>唯一の知り合いだし……。

@char Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate それでエマちゃんは<br>ヒロちゃんを<br>かばおうとしたんだ？

@char Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate そ、そういうわけじゃ<br>ないけど……！

@char Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate "でも、メルルちゃんと<br><link=\"Objection_02_01_08_02\">話したこと</link>を<br>みんなに伝えたら……<br>ヒロちゃんは<br>処刑されちゃうと思って……。"

@char Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL6,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Flushed_Middle,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate 人が死んで欲しくない<br>って思うの……<br>そんなに変なこと<br>なのかな？

@char Margo.Default,ArmR6,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate だから<br>メルルちゃんに<br>言われたことを<br>隠してたのね？

@char Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL6,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Flushed_Middle,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate "うん……。<br>でも……<br>ボクの知ってることと<br><link=\"Objection_02_01_08_03\">議論の流れ</link>に<br><link=\"Objection_02_01_08_04\">大きな違い</link>が<br>出てきたから……。"

@char Ema.Default,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Closed04,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Determined_Closed,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate 言わなきゃって……<br>思ったんだ。


@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@pauseTrial true
@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

